{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1488991-integrity-skill","id":1488991,"title":"Integrity Skill","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-03T10:43:42-07:00","id":1488991,"title":"Integrity Skill","content":"Hi, new player here for storypath.<br /> <br /> I thought I understood the concept behind Integrity skill, but then I came across the idea in the sluthing rules about using it as Alertness/ Awareness.<br /> <br /> Now I'm truly confused. Any ideas as to what it is intended to be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27511-fanggrip","name":"FangGrip","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T16:09:36-07:00","id":1489025,"title":"","content":"As the core book indicates, Integrity opposes Persuasion and Command (ie. resisting emotional manipulation), and is also used to hide your emotions (which can aid in lying) and focus your thoughts (ie. meditation). If you're using it for perception based reasons, it is presumably to detect if someone is trying to manipulate your emotions or to stay focused on something despite distracting complications.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T16:49:37-07:00","id":1489029,"title":"","content":"Also, for the system, in general it expects a lot of flexibility one what to roll for &quot;general&quot; actions. If a specific system calls for a specific roll, do that. Otherwise let the players make a case for rolling the Skill + Attribute they want if they can make sense for the situation. This means plenty of overlap, but that's purposeful (as it helps make sure that characters are generally capable of contributing to more situations and less likely to be sidelined while a specialist character does all the important stuff).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T16:51:28-07:00","id":1489030,"title":"","content":"Integrity is not a \u201caware\u201d skill, all skills are on their areas. Survival would be used in the wild, larceny in a crowd, etc. <br /> <br /> Integrity is useful to identify people going against your integrity, trying to convince you to do things, distracting you, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> 